      "repair_reason": "- [P1] Manual review is needed because the remaining blockers are contributor real-behavior proof, maintainer compatibility acceptance, and the protected maintainer label rather than a narrow mechanical repair.; Cleared: The diff changes local HTML text conversion and tests only; it adds no dependency, workflow, lockfile, secret handling, or broader supply-chain surface. (sha=87ebf94c37c153d686489dc01100b3fe3f0c501c)",
      "review_summary": "The branch replaces the regex-based web_fetch basic HTML-to-Markdown fallback with a quote-aware forward scanner and adds malformed-HTML, raw-text, anchor, title, and markdown-fence regression tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +546, Tests +260. Total +806 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: Not fully: source inspection shows current main still uses the broad regex fallback path this PR replaces, but the excessive-time symptom still lacks live web_fetch timing proof.",
